\begin{lem}[Bounded Recursion]\ollabel{transrecursionfun}
For any term $\tau(x)$ and any ordinal $\alpha$, there is a unique $\alpha$-approximation for $\tau$.
\end{lem}
\begin{proof}
We will show that, for any $\gamma \leq \alpha$, there is a unique
$\gamma$-approximation.

